  - evidenceTypes: 
    description: Bonome runs to hide inside the house. When you find him, interact
      with him so he runs to another hiding spot.
  - evidenceTypes: 06000000
    description: Bonome detects the radioactivity of the rooms he passes through
      and has a great chance of detecting whether the malevolent spirit is radioactive
      as he passes through it.
  - evidenceTypes: 
    description: When he moves, Bonome reveals the Grigris hidden around the house.
